WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Gather paper: Use two sheets, a ruler and pencil. Choose an easy-to-fold paper.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Mark the folds: Mark parallel fold lines about two centimetres apart.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Fold alternately: Alternate mountain and valley creases to make an accordion.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.800
Pack and deploy: Compress the paper, then reopen it repeatedly.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Measure: Compare the deployed width with its packed width.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Connect to spacecraft: Space structures also need hinges, rigidity and reliable deployment.

